<title>THAILAND: Trading in Thai Financial Trust halted.</title>
<headline>Trading in Thai Financial Trust halted.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai stock exchange on Friday halted trading in the shares of Thai Financial Trust Plc, for the morning session as it waited for the company to disclose some material information.</p>
<p>Shares if Thai Financial Trust on Thursday closed unchanged at 43 baht. Local newspapers have said the finance company was the subject of talk that a private group might be buying it. A Thai Financial official said the company had no comment on the report.</p>
</text>
